### Background and Context

The operational excellence and process optimization initiative emerged from strategic planning sessions conducted in Q2 2025 involving key stakeholders including Marcus Webb, Marcus Webb, and Admiral Michael Torres. The initiative aligns with the company's three-year strategic plan and supports revenue targets of $8.5B by 2027 with EBITDA margins of 24%.

