- Expand to 4 additional customer accounts
- Achieve positive EBITDA contribution of $49M
- Complete integration with Project Helios and Quantum-Secured Supply Chain

### Conclusion and Recommendations

The operational excellence and process optimization initiative represents a strategic priority for Manus Orion Group with significant revenue and market share implications. Successful execution requires continued executive sponsorship from Fatima Al-Mansoori, disciplined program management, and cross-functional collaboration.

